---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Stand with Israel - Kehilat Ohr HaTorah" pageTitle="Stand with Israel" pageIcon="fas fa-flag" description="Relief and service organizations connected with Israel and the Jewish people.">
    <p class="intro-text"><strong>Learn about organizations serving people in Israel and Jewish communities affected by conflict and displacement.</strong></p>
    <p class="page-note">Programs and leadership can change. Review each organization directly before giving.</p>

    <div class="ministries-list">
        <!-- Hope for Israel -->
        <div class="ministry-card">
            <div class="ministry-header">
                <i class="fas fa-heart" style="color: #0066cc;"></i>
                <h3>Hope for Israel</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="ministry-details">
                <p>A Jerusalem-based ministry focused on discipleship, Scripture teaching, and practical aid.</p>
                <div class="ministry-activities">
                    <h4><i class="fas fa-hands-helping"></i> Areas of service</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Humanitarian relief</li>
                        <li>Bible teaching and discipleship</li>
                        <li>Prayer updates</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <a href="https://hope4israel.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ministry-link">
                    Visit Hope for Israel <i class="fas fa-external-link-alt"></i>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Israel Relief Aid -->
        <div class="ministry-card">
            <div class="ministry-header">
                <i class="fas fa-medkit" style="color: #cc6600;"></i>
                <h3>Israel Relief Aid</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="ministry-details">
                <p>A humanitarian organization that distributes material aid through local partners in Israel.</p>
                <div class="ministry-activities">
                    <h4><i class="fas fa-hands-helping"></i> Areas of service</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Relief supplies</li>
                        <li>Community partnerships</li>
                        <li>Support for people in need</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <a href="https://israelrelief.org.il/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ministry-link">
                    Visit Israel Relief Aid <i class="fas fa-external-link-alt"></i>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Chevra USA -->
        <div class="ministry-card">
            <div class="ministry-header">
                <i class="fas fa-handshake" style="color: #009933;"></i>
                <h3>Chevra USA</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="ministry-details">
                <p>A humanitarian network serving Jewish communities and displaced families in Eastern Europe and Israel.</p>
                <div class="ministry-activities">
                    <h4><i class="fas fa-hands-helping"></i> Areas of service</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Food support</li>
                        <li>Help for displaced families</li>
                        <li>Immigration assistance</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Shiloh Israel Children's Fund -->
        <div class="ministry-card">
            <div class="ministry-header">
                <i class="fas fa-child" style="color: #cc0066;"></i>
                <h3>Shiloh Israel Children's Fund</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="ministry-details">
                <p>An organization supporting therapeutic and educational programs for Israeli children affected by violence and trauma.</p>
                <div class="ministry-activities">
                    <h4><i class="fas fa-hands-helping"></i> Areas of service</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Trauma-informed care</li>
                        <li>Art, music, and animal-assisted programs</li>
                        <li>Educational support</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <a href="https://www.shilohisraelchildren.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ministry-link">
                    Visit Shiloh Children's Fund <i class="fas fa-external-link-alt"></i>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="heart-section">
        <h3><i class="fas fa-praying-hands"></i> Pray for peace and healing</h3>
        <p>We pray for the safety, healing, and dignity of everyone affected by war, violence, and displacement.</p>
        <p><strong>If you choose to give, review an organization's current programs and accountability information directly.</strong></p>
    </div>
</PageLayout>

<style>
    .intro-text {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .page-note {
        margin: -15px 0 30px;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .ministries-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 25px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .ministry-card {
        background: var(--gray-100);
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .ministry-header {
        background: white;
        padding: 20px 25px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 15px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    }

    .ministry-header i {
        font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .ministry-header h3 {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--primary-blue);
        font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .ministry-details {
        padding: 25px;
    }

    .ministry-meta {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin: 0 0 15px 0;
    }

    .ministry-details > p {
        margin: 0 0 15px 0;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    .ministry-activities {
        margin: 15px 0;
    }

    .ministry-activities h4 {
        color: var(--gold-dark);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    }

    .ministry-activities ul {
        margin: 0;
        padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .ministry-activities li {
        margin-bottom: 6px;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .ministry-note {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin: 15px 0 !important;
    }

    .ministry-link {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: var(--primary-blue);
        color: white;
        padding: 10px 20px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: background 0.3s ease;
    }

    .ministry-link:hover {
        background: #004080;
    }

    .heart-section {
        background: rgba(0, 102, 204, 0.05);
        padding: 25px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-blue);
    }

    .heart-section h3 {
        color: var(--primary-blue);
        margin: 0 0 15px 0;
    }

    .heart-section p {
        margin: 0 0 15px 0;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    .heart-section p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }
</style>
